{"articleNo":"497485","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=497485&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [문학동네x아름책마루] 프란츠 카프카 타계 100주기 기념 특별 도서·원화전","writer":"도서관","writeDate":"2024.08.30","hit":"5396","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://library.kumoh.ac.kr/pyxis-api/attachments/BULLETIN/5bae385d-4c28-48d9-8c66-89f7df9c2cec\" style=\"height: 506px; width: 900px; clear: none; float: none;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://library.kumoh.ac.kr/pyxis-api/attachments/BULLETIN/c20fe7f6-7b3a-4154-9a43-0cca096e8b52\" style=\"height: 506px; width: 900px; clear: none; float: none;\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;문학동네X아름책마루 도서관</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;프란츠 카프카 타계 100주기 기념 특별 도서·원화 전시회</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;도서관에서는 신평동 캠퍼스 아름책마루 도서관 홍보 및 프란츠 카프카&nbsp;타계 100주기를 기념하여</p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;문학동네 출판사와 연계 협력 도서·원화 전시회를 개최하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다.</p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1. 전시주제: '카프카의 세계-카프카에스크(Kafkaesque)'</p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. 전시기간: 평일 2024. 9. 2.(월) ~ 2024. 9. 30.(월)&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3. 전시장소: (오프라인) 신평캠퍼스 아름책마루 (온라인) 도서관 홈페이지, 인스타 등</p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4. 전시시간: (오프라인)&nbsp;09:00~18:00 (온라인) 시간제약 없음</p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;5. 전시내용: 프란츠 카프카&nbsp;관련 도서 전시, 문학동네 온·오프라인 병행 원화 전시 &lt;프란츠 카프카의 그림들&gt;</p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6. 독서체험: 작가처럼 한 줄 서평쓰기(도서관 홈페이지 서평란에 공개됨)</p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;※ 전시회 기간 중 '회원가입' 또는 '한 줄 서평쓰기' 독서체험 참여자 중 추첨 10명 문화상품권(1만원) 증정</p>\n\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: left;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [문의] 국립금오공과대학교 신평캠퍼스 아름책마루 도서관 054-478-7179/7229</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
